### Node ###
# Build time dependencies of the Paella bundle. The bundle itself
# (paella-player.min.js) is shipped, its build tree is not. Note that the root
# node_modules/ is tracked on purpose, it ships the runtime dependencies, so
# this rule stays scoped to the Paella path.
